    "description": "- visit patreon.com/expanda_ac to unlock the full city freeroam for this track -<br><br>Grand City Parkway is a fictional recreation of Huston, Texas Parkway Ring Roads for Assetto Corsa - made by ExPanda. <br><br>The map consists of 6 super detailed city ringroads, that are visally inspired by the ringroads of Huston Texas. The roads are different themed, with scenes switching from beach drive, to suburbs, to inner city centre. Generally the map is meant for city drifting or parkway traffic driving, while offering a lot of interesting places and routes to discover.",
